<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - KOS rated initial buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - KOS rated initial buy.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Dillon Read said analysts Jerry Treppel and Andrew Forman initiated coverage of drug delivery company KOS Pharmaceuticals Inc with a buy rating and a 12-to-18-month price target of $37.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Friday at 25-1/2.</p>
</text>
